I hope this email finds you well. My name is Patrio Gabriel A. Patdu, and I
recently applied for admission to Batangas State University for the
upcoming academic year. I am writing to bring to your attention what seems
to be an error in my admission application.

I am going to inquire about my concern about the online admission. After
finishing my application for the online admission this error showed up (see
attached picture), I am going to ask if my application went through to the
system, or if it didn't, how can I resolve the issue?

If there are any additional steps I need to take or if you require further
information, please let me know, and I will promptly comply with your
requests.

Thank you for your understanding and assistance in resolving this matter. I
look forward to hearing from you soon.

